url: "https://github.com/amaniimtuniversity-ux/ea_auto"
abstract: >-
  Turn any topic into a YouTube-style teaching video with a Hindi (Hinglish) neural
  voiceover and English on-screen text. Every frame is drawn in code with Remotion
  (React + TypeScript): dark canvas, step-by-step diagrams, chapter progress bar,
  deterministic renders. Ships six scene types (hook, concept, steps, compare,
  number, recap) and a voiceover builder that writes the frame-accurate timeline.
keywords:
  - remotion
  - explainer-video
  - hinglish
  - hindi-tts
  - motion-graphics
  - study-video
  - typescript
